    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0002",
      "text": "## H-01 — BuilderWallet `init()` is permissionless and can be re-run to seize admin and steal funds",
      "start": 91,
      "end": 190,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0003",
      "text": "**Severity:** High",
      "start": 192,
      "end": 210,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0004",
      "text": "### Impact",
      "start": 212,
      "end": 222,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0005",
      "text": "Any unprivileged attacker can become `builderAdmin` for any deployed BuilderWallet and steal all ERC20 tokens held by that wallet (e.g., builder fee/commission receipts).",
      "start": 224,
      "end": 394,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0006",
      "text": "### Exploit narrative (attack steps)",
      "start": 396,
      "end": 432,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0007",
      "text": "Assumptions:",
      "start": 434,
      "end": 446,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0008",
      "text": "- A BuilderWallet exists (deployed by BuilderFactory) and holds ERC20 tokens.",
      "start": 447,
      "end": 524,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0009",
      "text": "Steps:",
      "start": 526,
      "end": 532,
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0010",
      "text": "1. Call `BuilderWallet.init(attacker)`.",
      "start": 533,
      "end": 572,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0011",
      "text": "2. Call `BuilderWallet.sweep(token, attacker)` for each token held.",
      "start": 573,
      "end": 640,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0012",
      "text": "### Affected components / code references (GitHub links)",
      "start": 642,
      "end": 698,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0013",
      "text": "- Unrestricted re-initialization: `https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/fe557748210a529ae414d7c487b6514be0d9e220/contracts/RiskEngine.sol#L2315`",
      "start": 700,
      "end": 859,
      "line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0014",
      "text": "- Sweep gated only by `builderAdmin`: `https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/fe557748210a529ae414d7c487b6514be0d9e220/contracts/RiskEngine.sol#L2319`",
      "start": 860,
      "end": 1023,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_8c066c54e937_0015",
      "text": "- Factory deploys wallet then calls `init` once (but does not prevent later calls): `https://github.com/code-423n4/2025-12-panoptic/blob/fe557748210a529ae414d7c487b6514be0d9e220/contracts/RiskEngine.sol#L2371`",
      "start": 1024,
      "end": 1233,
      "line": 24
    }
  ]
